From: Noa Himesaka <himesaka@noa.codes>
Subject: [PATCH] media: iris: support PREPEND_SPSPPS_TO_IDR on the HFI Gen1 encoder

VA-API encoders (qcom-va-driver) set V4L2_CID_MPEG_VIDEO_PREPEND_SPSPPS_TO_IDR
and fail when the control is missing, which it is on HFI Gen1.

HFI Gen1 has one switch for this: with
HFI_PROPERTY_CONFIG_VENC_SYNC_FRAME_SEQUENCE_HEADER enabled the firmware
emits the sequence header with every sync frame, which is what the
control asks for (venus drives the same property the same way). Expose
the control and enable the property when it is set, as well as for the
joined header mode it already covers.

Signed-off-by: Noa Himesaka <himesaka@noa.codes>
Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5-5
---
 drivers/media/platform/qcom/iris/iris_ctrls.c    |   12 +++++++++---
 drivers/media/platform/qcom/iris/iris_hfi_gen1.c |    7 +++++++
 2 files changed, 16 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/drivers/media/platform/qcom/iris/iris_ctrls.c b/drivers/media/platform/qcom/iris/iris_ctrls.c
index dbc4a6a..55c0c05 100644
--- a/drivers/media/platform/qcom/iris/iris_ctrls.c
+++ b/drivers/media/platform/qcom/iris/iris_ctrls.c
@@ -710,14 +710,20 @@ int iris_set_profile_level_gen1(struct iris_inst *inst, enum platform_inst_fw_ca
 int iris_set_header_mode_gen1(struct iris_inst *inst, enum platform_inst_fw_cap_type cap_id)
 {
 	const struct iris_hfi_session_ops *hfi_ops = inst->hfi_session_ops;
+	u32 prepend_sps_pps = inst->fw_caps[PREPEND_SPSPPS_TO_IDR].value;
 	u32 header_mode = inst->fw_caps[cap_id].value;
 	u32 hfi_id = inst->fw_caps[cap_id].hfi_id;
 	u32 hfi_val;
 
-	if (header_mode == V4L2_MPEG_VIDEO_HEADER_MODE_SEPARATE)
-		hfi_val = 0;
-	else
+	/*
+	 * HFI Gen1 has one switch for this: with SYNC_FRAME_SEQUENCE_HEADER
+	 * enabled the firmware emits the sequence header with every sync
+	 * frame, which is what PREPEND_SPSPPS_TO_IDR asks for.
+	 */
+	if (prepend_sps_pps || header_mode != V4L2_MPEG_VIDEO_HEADER_MODE_SEPARATE)
 		hfi_val = 1;
+	else
+		hfi_val = 0;
 
 	return hfi_ops->session_set_property(inst, hfi_id,
 					 HFI_HOST_FLAGS_NONE,
diff --git a/drivers/media/platform/qcom/iris/iris_hfi_gen1.c b/drivers/media/platform/qcom/iris/iris_hfi_gen1.c
index e4ad88f..55d86e2 100644
--- a/drivers/media/platform/qcom/iris/iris_hfi_gen1.c
+++ b/drivers/media/platform/qcom/iris/iris_hfi_gen1.c
@@ -150,6 +150,13 @@ static struct platform_inst_fw_cap inst_fw_cap_sm8250_enc[] = {
 		.flags = CAP_FLAG_OUTPUT_PORT | CAP_FLAG_MENU,
 		.set = iris_set_header_mode_gen1,
 	},
+	{
+		.cap_id = PREPEND_SPSPPS_TO_IDR,
+		.min = 0,
+		.max = 1,
+		.step_or_mask = 1,
+		.value = 0,
+	},
 	{
 		.cap_id = BITRATE,
 		.min = BITRATE_MIN,
